===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Characteristic of a [[burden]]; [[arduous]] or [[demanding]]
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1748|author=w:David Hume|title=Enquiries concerning the human understanding and concerning the principles of morals|location=London|publisher=Oxford University Press|year_published=1973|section=§ 6
|passage=. . . reap a pleasure from what, to the generality of mankind, may seem '''burdensome''' and laborious.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|year=1959|month=November|author=J. N. Westwood|title=The Railways of Canada|journal=Trains Illustrated|page=555|text=Finally, there are the commuter trains. Both companies operate these around the big cities and both find them '''burdensome''', owing to the lack of off-peak travel.}}

